# France Travail — API "Offres d'emploi v2"
#
# 1. Create an account on https://francetravail.io
# 2. Create an application, then subscribe it to "Offres d'emploi v2"
# 3. Copy the generated identifiers below (client id looks like PAR_xxx_yyy)
#
# Without these variables the server serves a deterministic demo dataset
# (~900 offers, identical JSON shape) so the prototype stays fully usable.

FT_CLIENT_ID=
FT_CLIENT_SECRET=
